### Testing
Every package in this release was installed, run and removed automatically on Windows, macOS and Linux (x86_64 and ARM) before the release was created.

Neither the Windows nor the macOS programs are code-signed. On Windows, if SmartScreen warns, choose *More info › Run anyway*. On macOS, right-click `install.command` and choose *Open*.

Checksums are in `SHA256SUMS.txt`. Licenses: `LICENSE` (MIT) and `THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.txt`, included in every package.
